Command: p
Effect : paste characters from clipboard
Modes  : @x

Examples:
p     - paste characters from clipboard at current character pointer
p @5  - paste characters from clipboard at character position 5

Note: The p and P commands have no way of knowing whether the data in the
      clipboard was generated using the c or C command.  Thus, using the
      p command to paste data from the C command will have messy results
      if there is more than one line on the clipboard.
